\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Conclusion\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 By re-centering firewall policy around applications and services, and by explicitly separating identity from network reality, enterprises can transform firewalls from brittle choke points into scalable, reliable enforcement controls. The architecture described here provides a practical, implementable path to that outcome using existing enterprise data and Palo Alto Networks platforms.\
